  intent: fall-001 Freefall Symphony. One marble falls through seven worlds and every
    bounce plays the next note of a famous song. Pads sit where the marble will be
    when the note is due; world 5 splits into a three-voice canon; world 7 accelerates.
    Seed is cosmetic only.
